      <p>This podcast presents interviews with researchers and practitioners in the domain of Early Childhood Music Education.</p>
      <p>A first series involves talks on general aspects of ECME.</p>
      <p>A second series addresses the theme of instrumental music learning &amp; teaching in Early Childhood.</p>
      <p>A third series addresses digitization in ECME.</p>
      <p>The ECiME-Podcast is hosted by <a class="line" href="https://www.lucnijs.be">Luc Nijs</a>, professor in Early Childhood Music Education and head of the Bachelor in Music Education at the University of Luxembourg.</p>
